A collection of packages containing: accenti dblfont; envmath; evenpage;
graphfig; mathcmd; quotes; and sobolev.

%package -n texlive-bpchem
Summary:        Typeset chemical names, formulae, etc.
Version:        svn75878
License:        LPPL-1.3c
